## 3. Host Discovery & Sanity Checks

Before scheduling pods, trainees can test iSCSI portal visibility from any worker node (`kube-worker-1`):

```bash
# Discover available targets from worker
sudo iscsiadm -m discovery -t sendtargets -p {{ cka_lab_iscsi_portal }}

# Expected output:
# {{ cka_lab_iscsi_portal }},1 {{ cka_lab_iscsi_iqn }}
```

